    "scope": "Three useful inspected pictures and standard viewer PMTiles/DEM;no bespoke surveys or redistributed pixels. An additional 2018 south-court picture was viewed but adds no controls. The 2016 winter-hall file page was read without viewing its picture and is not a geometry reference.",
    "pictures": [
